# Build-time config for `vite build` (production).
# The manager dashboard's Express API (products, orders, login, publish, uploads)
# lives on Render. Without this, API_BASE falls back to http://localhost:5001 and
# a deployed /manage login fails with ERR_CONNECTION_REFUSED.
# This used to be set ONLY as a Cloudflare build variable, which silently broke
# every manual `wrangler deploy` built from a local machine. Keeping it in the
# repo makes local and CI builds identical. Not a secret — it's a public URL.
VITE_API_URL=https://lev-hatahbiv-api.onrender.com
